prompt:
Un cliente con esta política se conecta, se suscribe a `trucks/#` y otros dispositivos publican en `trucks/camion-01/telemetry`. ¿Qué ocurre?
```json
{
  "Version": "2012-10-17",
  "Statement": [
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "iot:Connect",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:iot:eu-west-1:123456789012:client/*"
    },
    {
      "Effect": "Allow",
      "Action": "iot:Subscribe",
      "Resource": "arn:aws:iot:eu-west-1:123456789012:topicfilter/trucks/*"
    }
  ]
}
```
